(7183060, 1103493, 15511, '<td valign="top">Composition, lighting, colors and balance, subject matter and editing are so pleasing to look at. I like everything about this except for the over-sharpening. This image cries out for more pixels...</td>', 'Composition, lighting, colors and balance, subject matter and editing are so pleasing to look at. I like everything about this except for the over-sharpening. This image cries out for more pixels...', '2014-02-28 22:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
