(7183891, 1103174, 114285, '<td valign="top">One of those candid moments that you could write a story about, has a certain energy to it. Almost like the kid wants some action, brave soul. One of the better ones for sure.</td>', 'One of those candid moments that you could write a story about, has a certain energy to it. Almost like the kid wants some action, brave soul. One of the better ones for sure.', '2014-03-02 02:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7183892, 1104030, 114285, '<td valign="top">Would love to know the story behind this, was it a setup or a candid. I feel the girls pain, but the guy is not convincing, he is kind of static, lacking in emotion, he doesn''t know how to feel because no one taught him maybe, he''s reaching out but in a half hearted manner. Top ten for me.</td>', 'Would love to know the story behind this, was it a setup or a candid. I feel the girls pain, but the guy is not convincing, he is kind of static, lacking in emotion, he doesn''t know how to feel because no one taught him maybe, he''s reaching out but in a half hearted manner. Top ten for me.', '2014-03-02 02:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7183893, 1103349, 114285, '<td valign="top">I get the feeling if I really had to go, I wouldn''t want to go in them!<br/> <br/>The only redeeming factor is the way you framed the cyclist.</td>', 'I get the feeling if I really had to go, I wouldn''t want to go in them! The only redeeming factor is the way you framed the cyclist.', '2014-03-02 02:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
