(7186259, 1103011, 70270, '<td valign="top">i love forest blur, and take a lot of these shots myself.  i tend to like the more silky smooth ones, that come from faster camera movement or a slower shutter or both, and tend to pitch the ones that turn out like this. But now I have to reconsider, because there is something about this one I really like - maybe its the way the image is divided between the lines of grass and the lines of trunks.</td>', 'i love forest blur, and take a lot of these shots myself.  i tend to like the more silky smooth ones, that come from faster camera movement or a slower shutter or both, and tend to pitch the ones that turn out like this. But now I have to reconsider, because there is something about this one I really like - maybe its the way the image is divided between the lines of grass and the lines of trunks.', '2014-03-06 15:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
